==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂el- (other)}}
{{bor+|en|la|alternātus}}, the {{glossary|perfect}} {{glossary|passive}} {{glossary|participle}} of {{der|en|la|alternō||to take turns}} (see {{m|en|-ate|pos=1,2 and 3}}), from {{m|la|alternus||one after another, by turns}}, from {{m|la|alter||other}} + {{m|la|-nus}}. {{dbt|en|altern}}; see also {{m|en|alter}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|eɪt|s=3}}
; Adjective, noun
