===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# That which alternates with something else; [[vicissitude]].
#* {{RQ:Prior Solomon|passage=Grateful '''alternates''' of substantial peace.}}
# {{lb|en|US}} A [[substitute]]; an [[alternative]]; one designated to take the place of another, if necessary, in performing some duty.
#: {{ux|en|An '''alternate''' for the first-string quarterback played the entire first half.}}
#* {{quote-video game|en|developer=Bungie|authorlink=Bungie|title=w:Halo 3|publisher=w:Microsoft Game Studios|date=25 September 2007|system=w:Xbox 360|role={{w|Cortana (Halo)|Cortana}}|actor=w:Jen Taylor|level=[https://www.halopedia.org/Cortana_(level) Cortana]|passage=Corridors beyond this point have collapsed. I'm looking for an '''alternate'''. Careful.}}
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} A [[proportion]] derived from another proportion by interchanging the [[means]].
# {{lb|en|US}} A replacement of equal or [[greater]] value or function.

